#question(title: [A different type of logarithm])[
  Calculate the derivative of
  $
    f(x) = log_(x + 1) (x^2 + 1)
  $

  #v(1fr)

  #emph[Note:] This is a new function. We
  have not given you a formula for it yet,
  That is on purpose.

  #v(1fr)

  #emph[Hint:] If you do not know where to
  start, remember the definition of
  logarithm:
  $
    log_a b = c thick <==> thick a^c = b .
  $
]
